{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_07",
  "title": "有客先来",
  "storyCode": "RI-7",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "45d7acab87aa7d5bf3e5790b66fc7d705b999328c20b0369d0cbd655d3e7ef6a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "哇啊啊啊啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "text": "啧，又失败了，不过这次飞的弧度不错啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "text": "飞哪儿去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "text": "不知道，反正待会儿就跑回来了吧，我们继续。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "text": "那么，这根管子该接哪里呢——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "text": "哈哈，这个接口长的很正点啊，就插你了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "text": "喂，能发动吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "text": "不行啊，你到底会不会啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "text": "叫什么叫，这个引擎我从来没见过，让我多试试！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "text": "让我来试试！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "text": "照我看，这根管子应该插这里，然后这个按钮是啥？算了，按了就对了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "text": "你这家伙才是在乱搞啊！明明应该这样插才对！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人C",
      "text": "你们两个蠢货在干什么，油管都没插上，还是得我来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人C",
      "text": "油管该插哪儿来着，算了，这个口比较大，就你了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人C",
      "text": "喂， 谁来启动一下试试！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "我回来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "现在的年轻人真是不懂尊敬老人，我被炸出去了也没有人来找我一下吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "text": "可是大祭司大人你每次都会像现在这样好好地跑回来啊，大家都习惯了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "text": "哎呀，别废话了，赶紧启动试试！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "好好好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大丑",
      "text": "————！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "大丑，我的好孩子，该起床了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "text": "噢！大酋长，它终于动了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "text": "这美妙的引擎声！我从来没听过这么动听的声音！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人C",
      "text": "哈哈，我就说还是得我来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "你们是怎么做到的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "text": "就像你看到的一样啊，大酋长，它就是这样动了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "text": "把这根管子插在这里，然后把那根管子插在那里！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人C",
      "text": "就像我们怎么造出的大丑一样！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "啊，曾经是一坨废铁的大丑，今天居然已经变得这么像样了，啊，此情此景，真是让我想高歌一曲！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "但你唱歌很难听。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "什么？！好吧，我还觉得我挺有歌唱天赋的......真遗憾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "哦，对，或许是唱法的问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "嗯，没错，一定是这样，下次我要试试美声的唱法！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人",
      "text": "大酋长，有人冲进来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "是嘉维尔吗？我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人",
      "text": "不是！是一个带着很多武器的怪胎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "text": "前面应该就是祖玛玛的部族了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "这家伙，居然把自己的部族都改造成这样了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "看起来挺厉害啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "text": "咦，里面怎么好像很热闹的样子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "嗯？怎么就打起来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "text": "可恶的整合运动，居然想要抢走小刻的名字，这可是比蜜饼还要珍贵的东西，小刻绝不原谅你们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
      "text": "嘎啊啊啊啊啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
      "text": "这个怪胎是哪里来的，好厉害！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人C",
      "text": "虽然听得懂她说的是什么，但是整合运动是什么啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "text": "咦，那不是小刻吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "听动静，小刻应该已经在里面闹起来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "text": "总之，先让她冷静下来吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "小刻快停手！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "小刻加油！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
